      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Those of us who were able to make their way to this camp have managed
          to scrape together enough to last at least into the immediate future. Though
          I can only fathom to guess where the captain and those other officers went.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
